  {"name": "a planned week and what was done", "reason": "Per set a lift adds set_factor * (targets + 0.5 * synergists). Squat: 1 target + 3 synergists = 2.5. Bench: 1 target + 2 synergists = 2.0. Deadlift: 1 target (glutes) + 3 synergists = 2.5. Planned Monday: 3*1.0*2.5 + 3*1.1*2.0 (target RPE 9 gives 1.1) = 14.1. Planned Wednesday: 8 km at z 1: q = 0.18*8 = 1.44, calves 0.8q, glutes 0.5q, hamstrings 0.4q: 1.44*2.7 = 3.8879999999999995. Planned Friday: 2*1*2.5 = 5. Planned Saturday: 12 km at z 1.5 ('hard'): q = 3.24, hamstrings 0.8q: 3.24*3.1 = 10.044. Done Monday: squat 3*1.0*2.5 = 7.5 plus bench 2 sets at RPE 9.5 (factor 1.15): 2*1.15*2.0 = 4.6, total 12.1. Done Wednesday: first run with no critical speed, so z 1 = 3.8879999999999995. Done Sunday: the 22:00 -04:00 deadlift is Monday 02:00 UTC but Sunday local: one set at RPE 7 (factor 0.9): 0.9*2.5 = 2.25 on Sunday. The Sunday before the week, the Tuesday stub and the Monday after are not counted.", "input": {"v": 1, "planned": [{"kind": "lift", "exercises": [{"exerciseId": "squat", "sets": 3}, {"exerciseId": "benchPress", "sets": 3, "targetRpe": 9}]}, {"kind": "rest"}, {"kind": "run", "distanceM": 8000, "zone": 1.0}, {"kind": "rest"}, {"kind": "lift", "exercises": [{"exerciseId": "deadlift", "sets": 2, "targetRpe": 8}]}, {"kind": "run", "distanceM": 12000, "zone": "hard"}, {"kind": "rest"}], "settings": {}, "weekStart": "2026-09-14", "records": [{"kind": "lift", "id": "before", "startedAt": "2026-09-13T20:00:00-04:00", "entries": [{"exerciseId": "squat", "sets": [{"weight": 100, "unit": "lb", "reps": 5, "rpe": 8, "completed": true}, {"weight": 100, "unit": "lb", "reps": 5, "rpe": 8, "completed": true}, {"weight": 100, "unit": "lb", "reps": 5, "rpe": 8, "completed": true}, {"weight": 100, "unit": "lb", "reps": 5, "rpe": 8, "completed": true}, {"weight": 100, "unit": "lb", "reps": 5, "rpe": 8, "completed": true}]}]}, {"kind": "lift", "id": "mon", "startedAt": "2026-09-14T17:30:00-04:00", "entries": [{"exerciseId"